@Dentist_service_HostAddress = http://localhost:5068
@appointmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@dentistId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@serviceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Alterar agendamento existente
PUT {{Dentist_service_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}
X-Dentist-Id: {{dentistId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dentistId": "{{dentistId}}",
  "serviceId": "{{serviceId}}",
  "startAt": "2026-11-02T10:00:00-03:00",
  "type": "Private",
  "insuranceName": null,
  "insuranceCardNumber": null
}
